-     * Hold the file like a still frame; disc_nav_update() keeps pumping the
-     * VM at 20Hz so button navigation and title jumps still work. */
+    /* A BD-J navigation session (disc-menu mode) is active: menu titles can be
+     * pure ARGB -- no A/V packets -- and title switches leave a gap while the
+     * slave demuxer reopens, both reporting EOF. Hold the file like a still
+     * frame; disc_nav_update() keeps pumping the VM at 20Hz so button
+     * navigation and title jumps still work, and the resync seek retries
+     * until real data resumes. */
     prevent_eof |= mpctx->disc_nav_menu_active;
     /* It's possible for the user to simultaneously switch both audio
      * and video streams to "disabled" at runtime. Handle this by waiting
